'''One, Two, Three''' (Japanese: '''{{j|{{tt|１・２・３|ワン・ツー・スリー}}}}''') is the first Japanese opening theme of ''[[Pokémon Journeys: The Series]]''. It debuted in [[JN001]], replacing [[Your Adventure]] of ''[[Pokémon the Series: Sun & Moon]]''.

==Versions==

