===Synopsis===
The intro starts with {{Ash}} and {{AP|Lucario}} then turns to [[Goh]] and his {{TP|Goh|Sobble}} and {{TP|Goh|Cinderace}}, and finally turns to [[Chloe]] and her {{TP|Chloe|Eevee}}. Pikachu runs to Leon's car where Ash, Goh, Leon, Lucario an Cinderace are. Then, while Chloe walks to the car, [[Ash's Gengar]] comes to the car scaring Goh and Chloe. The next scene shows Ash, Goh, Chloe, their Pokémon, and Leon near a river, then at a cliff. Then, {{TP|Goh|Grookey}}, Sobble, and Pikachu appear and Grookey hits its branch on the ground, scaring Sobble and causing it to go into its camouflage, after that, Grookey jumps onto Goh's head and then Ash's head, which causes both of them to fall.

The next scene shows Goh and Cinderace, and then he sees the three legendary beasts, {{p|Raikou}}, {{p|Entei}}, and {{p|Suicune}}. Then, the next scene shows a character holding a Poké Ball from each turn, {{an|Professor Oak}}, [[Professor Cerise]], [[Chrysa]], [[Ren]], {{an|Korrina}}, [[Sonia]], [[Bea]], [[Wikstrom]], {{an|Iris}}, and {{Gary}}. Then, Ash and Goh see Leon, with Leon doing his signature pose. Then, it shows the car with Leon, Ash, Goh, Chloe and Pikachu, in the car which Leon has drove off a cliff.

After the car lands, it shows a Dynamax Galarian {{p|Yamask}}, a Dynamax {{p|Wooloo}}, and a Gigantamax {{MTR}}, zooming in to see [[Jessie]], [[James]], {{TP|Jessie|Wobbuffet}}, and {{an|Morpeko}} on top. Chloe sits at her desk then sees Ash and Goh doing the pose in the first One, Two, Three! opening. Chloe is entertained and then sees her {{TP|Professor Cerise|Yamper}} and Eevee. Then, Eevee jumps onto her left arm and then jumps off her right arm.

Then, Chloe sees all eight [[Eeveelution]]s, and has a smile. Then, Mew, Celebi, Jirachi, Shaymin, Victini, Hoopa, Zeraora, and Zarude appear. Ash and Goh jump and go onto {{p|Lugia}}, after that, Ash and Lucario, with Goh and Cinderace, battle on a rainy day. After that, it shows Ash and Pikachu battling {{an|Leon}} and his {{TP|Leon|Charizard}}. Then, it shows the car with Leon, Ash, Goh, Chloe, and Pikachu inside, going through seeing some Pokémon and Trainers from the past. Finally, the [[title card]] shows up and the intro ends.

