===Variants===
* [[JN100]]: The original animation.
* [[JN101]]: Goh's {{p|Gossifleur}} is added to the shot of the Pokémon he has that are based in [[Galar]]. 
* [[JN102]]: Goh's {{p|Durant}} is added to the shot of the Pokémon he has that are based in [[Unova]].
* [[JN103]]: Goh's {{p|Golbat}}, {{p|Graveler}}, and {{p|Cloyster}} are added to the shot of the Pokémon he has that are based in [[Kanto]].
* [[JN104]]: Goh's {{p|Froakie}} is added to the shot of the Pokémon he has that are based in [[Kalos]].
* [[JN106]]: Goh's {{p|Altaria}} is added to the shot of the Pokémon he has that are based in [[Hoenn]].
* [[JN108]]: The scene featuring [[Marnie]] and [[Piers]] is replaced with a scene featuring [[Raihan]] and Goh's evolved {{p|Frogadier}} is now shown in the shot of the Pokémon that he has based in [[Kalos]].
* [[JN110]]: The scene featuring Ash's Pikachu using {{m|10,000,000 Volt Thunderbolt}} is changed slightly so that the rainbow-colored bolts of electricity join together to create a circle split into parts featuring everyone in the Masters Eight of the [[World Coronation Series]], minus Ash, glancing at the camera. The scene of Ash facing Leon and his Gigantamax Charizard now also includes the other Masters Eight lined up alongside Leon. The scene of [[Ash's Greninja]] is replaced to include Ash commanding his {{AP|Lucario}} to create a gigantic {{m|Aura Sphere}}.
* [[JN114]]: Goh's {{p|Regieleki}} is added to the shot of the Pokémon he has that are based in [[Galar]].
* [[JN115]] - [[JN136]]: The scene featuring [[Raihan]] is replaced with a scene featuring [[Hop]] and his {{p|Wooloo}}.

