==Lyrics==
The lyrics for all versions of the song are identical with the exception of the following:
* The second version performed by Nishikawa-kun and Kirishō does not include the {{tt|（ナイ！）|(nai!)}} or {{tt|（トライ！）|(torai!)}} parentheticals.
* In the third version performed by the Karaage Sisters, the lines 「どこへ行こうか？」は / 「どこへだって行ける」でしょ？ are pronounced as ''&quot;Doko e ikō ka?&quot; wa / &quot;Doko e datte ikeru?&quot; desho?''.

